+issueNumber: MDL-85977
+notes:
+  mod_bigbluebuttonbn:
+    - message: >-
+        A new admin setting `bigbluebuttonbn_recording_all_formats` (comma
+        separated list) defines the recording formats available in the
+        "Recording formats viewable by everyone" setting, so new formats can be
+        made available without modifying the source code. New helpers
+        `config::get_recording_formats()`, `config::get_recording_safe_formats()`
+        and `config::parse_recording_formats()` have been added.
+      type: added
